            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.45

- Fixes project-sorted thread lists so pinned threads no longer affect the ordering, counts, or latest activity time of their original project section.
- Restores unpinned threads to normal project sorting as soon as they are unpinned.
- Adds regression coverage for pinned and unpinned project sorting behavior.
]]></description>
